{
  "description": "The realistic-template corpus for the cross-leg parity harness (php/tests/parity.php) and the writer read-back (scripts/parity/writers.py). Each case renders one template with one data set; `preview: true` renders with the declared examples. The hostile sets carry the data a template must never let through: formula injection, markup, token-looking text, page fields, non-ASCII.",
